# Database Rules

## Tables (key)

- `simulations`, `users`, `admin_users`, `chat_users`, `messages`, `tokens`
- `upload_files`, `favourite_images`, `jobs`

## chat_users naming (private threads)

`{Terminal}-{AdminName}-{Role}` e.g. `T1-Keith O'Brien-CEO`

## Migrations

- Use Laravel 5.6 migration format
- Provide companion SQL in `docker/mysql/` for manual apply:

```bash
docker compose exec -T db mysql -u ichat -pichat_secret ichat < docker/mysql/your-file.sql
```

## Report summary

- `simulations.history_summary_url` stores S3 object key — see `.cursor/features/report-summary.md`
- SQL patch: `docker/mysql/04-add-history-summary-url.sql`
